# Vidalune for Windows: settings for the server, read each time Vidalune starts.
# Change a line, remove the # in front of it, and choose Restart in the Vidalune icon next to the clock.
# Most settings are not here but in Vidalune itself (Admin).

# The port of the website, http://localhost:3000 on this PC.
#PORT=3000

# Where libraries may be. Leave it out to allow every drive Windows has ready (C:\, D:\, network drives).
#MEDIA_ROOTS=D:\Media,E:\
